      title: "A strapless BCBG gown for her first CMT win",
      summary: "A strapless BCBG Max Azria gown, all tulle skirt and neutral tones, the night \"Tim McGraw\" won Breakthrough Video of the Year.",
      body: ["The dress was the frame; the night was the milestone. \"Tim McGraw\" took Breakthrough Video of the Year at the 2007 CMT Music Awards — per Hello!, the first award of her career — for the Trey Fanjoy-directed video shot at a Hendersonville, Tennessee cabin once owned by Johnny Cash. Hello!'s retrospective logs the winning look in full (strapless neckline, neutral tones, tulle skirt) and notes she changed into a shimmery sea-green gown with a long train to present another award later that evening."],
