      title: "folklore's surprise debut: 846,000 units and her seventh No. 1 album",
      summary: "With essentially no advance promotion, folklore opened with 846,000 equivalent album units — 615,000 in pure sales plus 289.85 million on-demand streams, the biggest streaming week of 2020 for any album by a woman.",
      body: ["folklore debuted atop the Billboard 200 with 846,000 equivalent album units — Swift's seventh No. 1 album — including 615,000 in pure album sales, the largest sales week for any album since her own Lover (679,000) the year before. Its 218,000 in streaming-equivalent units came from 289.85 million on-demand streams of the album's tracks, the largest streaming week of 2020 for an album by a woman."],
