      body: ["The Nov. 22, 2020 wins — her third straight Artist of the Year, plus favorite pop/rock female and favorite music video for \"cardigan\" — pushed her career AMA total from 29 to 32, extending her own all-time record. The re-recording reveal, dropped almost as an aside, set up the Taylor's Version era that would define the next three years."],
