      dateLabel: "September 2019",
      title: "Lover Fest: a festival instead of a tour",
      summary: "Her announced plan for the era, revealed Sept. 17, 2019: skip the full stadium slog and throw a handful of self-headlined festival weekends instead — including opening the brand-new SoFi Stadium in Los Angeles.",
      body: ["Lover Fest East and West were set for summer 2020 — Foxborough's Gillette Stadium and two nights at SoFi, which she would have been the first performer ever to open — plus European festival dates. She framed the format as a deliberate breather after the reputation Stadium Tour: fewer shows, bigger parties."],
      tags: ["Tour"],
      sources: [{ name: "Lover Fest", url: "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lover_Fest" }],
