      id: "vault-lover-headlining-we-can-survive-at-the-hollywood-bowl",
      slug: "we-can-survive-hollywood-bowl",
      date: "2019-10-01",
      dateLabel: "October 2019",
      title: "Headlining We Can Survive at the Hollywood Bowl",
      summary: "Oct. 19, 2019: closing a radio-benefit bill of Billie Eilish, Lizzo, Camila Cabello and the Jonas Brothers with a hits-and-Lover set — one of the few times the Lover era made it to a live stage at all.",
      body: ["The annual 97.1 AMP Radio benefit was part of the era's strange, tour-less rhythm: award shows, radio nights, and one Paris theater instead of stadiums — which made every one-off like this feel outsized."],
