      body: ["Swift brought in Butch Walker to produce, saying she knew he would approach it \"from an organic place, which is where [Sheeran] comes from.\" Released as a single in July 2013, it reached No. 32 on the Hot 100 and went double platinum, and the two performed it as a duet throughout the Red Tour. The Philip Andelman video, out that June, cast two child actors as elementary-school classmates falling into an easy friendship — with Swift and Sheeran revealed at the end as their parents."],
