      body: ["Built in 1929-30 and later owned by Standard Oil heiress Rebekah Harkness, the estate came with more than 700 feet of private beachfront. News of the all-cash purchase broke in spring 2013; within a year the house was hosting the squad's Independence Day gatherings, and in 2020 Harkness's story became \"The Last Great American Dynasty\" on folklore."],
