      slug: "red-bridal-shower-surprise",
      date: "2014-04-01",
      dateLabel: "April 2014",
      title: "She flies to Ohio to crash a fan's bridal shower",
      summary: "Gena Gabrielle mailed her an invitation not expecting a reply — Taylor showed up in Columbus with a KitchenAid mixer, a cookbook, and hand-painted gifts, telling the room it was her first bridal shower ever.",
      body: ["Gabrielle, a fan Swift had first met at a 2007 meet-and-greet, sent the invite as a long shot; Swift planned the April 2014 surprise with her management and her mom and flew to Ohio for the day. The stunned-bride video made national news — one of the era's defining direct-to-fans gestures, a year before Swiftmas took the same instinct to scale."],
