      body: ["The 2014 leg carried the show from London's O2 through Berlin and on to Shanghai, Jakarta, Manila and Singapore. The planned June 9 Bangkok concert was called off following the May 2014 coup d'etat in Thailand. The Singapore finale closed out the run that Billboard would shortly crown the highest-grossing country tour of all time."],
