      title: "A rare public appearance with Joe Alwyn at the BAFTAs",
      summary: "The notoriously private couple stepped out together at the after-party, celebrating \"The Favourite\" winning seven BAFTAs.",
      body: ["On February 10, 2019, The Favourite won seven BAFTAs — including Outstanding British Film, Best Actress for Olivia Colman, and Best Supporting Actress for Rachel Weisz — with Alwyn in the cast as Samuel Masham. Swift skipped the ceremony and red carpet entirely, surfacing at the after-party at his side in a flowing Stella McCartney gown, and let Instagram do the talking: \"AHHHHH @thefavouritemovie just won 7 @bafta awards !!! Bout to go give some high fives.\""],
