      title: "...Ready for It? debuts inside a college football broadcast",
      summary: "The album's opener premiered September 2, 2017, soundtracking a hype promo for Alabama vs. Florida State on ABC — reputation's second single, delivered to a stadium audience before pop radio got it.",
      body: ["The minute-long clip scored footage of the teams taking the field during the ABC/ESPN broadcast, with the full song hitting streaming that night and radio the next morning. Dropping a pop single through a football telecast read very differently six years later, once the NFL became part of her story."],
