      slug: "rep-babe-to-sugarland",
      date: "2018-04-01",
      dateLabel: "April 2018",
      title: "She gives Babe, a Red-era outtake, to Sugarland",
      summary: "Written with Train's Pat Monahan for Red and left off the album, \"Babe\" surfaced April 20, 2018 as a Sugarland single — with Taylor on the track and, later, playing the other woman in its Mad Men-styled video.",
      body: ["Swift pitched the six-year-old outtake to the duo when she heard they'd reunited. She sang backing vocals, and the two acts performed it together live for the first time at the reputation Stadium Tour's Arlington finale that October. Her own version eventually arrived in 2021 as a from-the-vault track on Red (Taylor's Version)."],
