      dateLabel: "May 2018",
      title: "Katy Perry sends a literal olive branch on opening night",
      summary: "Waiting in Taylor's dressing room before the May 8, 2018 tour kickoff: an actual olive branch and a handwritten note from Katy Perry beginning \"Hello old friend\" — the public end of pop's longest-running feud.",
      body: ["\"So I just got to my dressing room and found this actual olive branch. This means so much,\" Swift said on her Instagram Story before taking the stage in Glendale. The gesture closed the loop on the falling-out widely understood to be behind \"Bad Blood\" — and set up their on-camera reunion in the \"You Need to Calm Down\" video a year later."],
