      body: ["The gown was J. Mendel pre-fall 2011 — strapless, dove grey, with an extra-long train she gathered up in one hand for the whole walk to the stage. The win itself was the bigger statement: it made her only the second female artist in CMA history, after Barbara Mandrell, to win Entertainer of the Year twice, closing out the Speak Now era's awards run at the top of country music's own room."],
