      body: ["Femestella IDs it as a Theia red sequin slip, worn with the same Everybody Fargo black knee-high boots she paired with the gold Cavalli fringe — the tour's up-tempo footwear of choice. In a show of nine costume changes otherwise dominated by chiffon and fairy-tale ballgowns, the slinky red sequin for the album's angriest song was the deliberate exception."],
